{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "1CO",
  "chapter": 10,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I would not, brethren, have you ignorant, that our fathers were all under the cloud, and all passed through the sea;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and were all baptized unto Moses in the cloud and in the sea;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and did all eat the same spiritual food;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and did all drink the same spiritual drink: for they drank of a spiritual rock that followed them: and the rock was Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Howbeit with most of them God was not well pleased: for they were overthrown in the wilderness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now these things were our examples, to the intent we should not lust after evil things, as they also lusted.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither be ye idolaters, as were some of them; as it is written, The people sat down to eat and drink, and rose up to play.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither let us commit fornication, as some of them committed, and fell in one day three and twenty thousand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither let us make trial of the Lord, as some of them made trial, and perished by the serpents.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Neither murmur ye, as some of them murmured, and perished by the destroyer.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now these things happened unto them by way of example; and they were written for our admonition, upon whom the ends of the ages are come.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore let him that thinketh he standeth take heed lest he fall.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There hath no temptation taken you but such as man can bear: but God is faithful, who will not suffer you to be tempted above that ye are able; but will with the temptation make also the way of escape, that ye may be able to endure it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore, my beloved, flee from idolatry.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I speak as to wise men; judge ye what I say.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The cup of blessing which we bless, is it not a communion of the blood of Christ? The bread which we break, is it not a communion of the body of Christ?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "seeing that we, who are many, are one bread, one body: for we all partake of the one bread.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold Israel after the flesh: have not they that eat the sacrifices communion with the altar?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What say I then? that a thing sacrificed to idols is anything, or that an idol is anything?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "I say",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", that the things which the Gentiles sacrifice, they sacrifice to demons, and not to God: and I would not that ye should have communion with demons.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye cannot drink the cup of the Lord, and the cup of demons: ye cannot partake of the table of the Lord, and of the table of demons.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Or do we provoke the Lord to jealousy? are we stronger than he?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All things are lawful; but not all things are expedient. All things are lawful; but not all things edify.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let no man seek his own, but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "each",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his neighbor’s ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "good",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whatsoever is sold in the shambles, eat, asking no question for conscience’ sake;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "for the earth is the Lord’s, and the fulness thereof.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If one of them that believe not biddeth you ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to a feast",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and ye are disposed to go; whatsoever is set before you, eat, asking no question for conscience’ sake.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But if any man say unto you, This hath been offered in sacrifice, eat not, for his sake that showed it, and for conscience’ sake:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "conscience, I say, not thine own, but the other’s; for why is my liberty judged by another conscience?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I partake with thankfulness, why am I evil spoken of for that for which I give thanks?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whether therefore ye eat, or drink, or whatsoever ye do, do all to the glory of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Give no occasion of stumbling, either to Jews, or to Greeks, or to the church of God:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.10.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:1CO.10.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "even as I also please all men in all things, not seeking mine own profit, but the ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "profit",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the many, that they may be saved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
